" stroke-width=\"0\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#a33\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"72\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#a33\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><circle cx=\"222\" cy=\"88\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#a33\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"255\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"normal\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#222\">spray</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#222\">vertical tube</text><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1\"/></svg></div>If the air speed over the tube is doubled, the reduction in pressure at the top of the tube (compared with atmospheric pressure) becomes:",
