      ans: "0.060 m/s",
      reason: "At terminal speed 6πηrv = W − U, so v = 2r²g(ρ − σ) / (9η) = 2 × (2.0×10⁻³)² × 9.8 × 6540 / (9 × 0.95) = 0.060 m/s. 0.072 m/s ignores the upthrust."
