" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">U = upthrust</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">F = viscous drag</text></svg></div>What is the magnitude of the viscous drag F on the ball at the terminal speed?",
